/v1/","context":{"app_id":4943000,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4943000-1846651706686066","game_id":"steam-4943000","kind":"announcement","title":"Hourly Raid: THE EVERGROWING","summary":"Hourly Raid: THE EVERGROWINGSlay the first boss, then open the Satellite Uplink and join the raid.An immortal colossus, fought alongside other pilots. Your score is the damage you deal.A new leaderboard that resets every hour.Pass the hour's goal together and the boss bleeds 5x loot: ore, crystal and APEX.Shoot the eye for double damage. The little eyes burst and grow back.Dodge the tentacle slams and the bone rockets.Your own guns, upgrades and Overcharge come with you.Also newA short notice on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:46:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686066","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943000-1846018067942739","game_id":"steam-4943000","kind":"update","title":"Major Update: The Mother Ship Grows, the Community Goal & 30 Languages","summary":"Hello pilots! This is the biggest ECHIDNA demo update so far, and it lands right before Steam Next Fest (October 19). Since the last patch the mother ship has grown new stations, carcasses fight back with surprises, every run has more to chase, and the whole game is now in 30 languages. Here is everything that changed. Community Goal: strip together, unlock togetherEvery carcass every player strips now counts toward one shared number. Build the Satellite Uplink on your mother ship and open the C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:55:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942739","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943000-1840944183781188","game_id":"steam-4943000","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Accessibility & Balance","summary":"AccessibilityMouse-only mode. The ship now rides the ring under your cursor, and the middle button covers dash / docking / closing a console. Toggle it in Settings → Gameplay. Keyboard aiming and firing. The arrow keys aim and pull the trigger, and the right hardpoint finally has a key of its own (E, rebindable). The second weapon you bought is no longer mouse-only. Menus on the keyboard. Arrows step the focus, Enter activates. Every console is now reachable without a mouse. Tutorial tips can be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T01:42:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943000-1839676055881055","game_id":"steam-4943000","kind":"update","title":"Tutorial & Readability Update","summary":"New Interactive TutorialAdded movement, aiming, shooting, and target-breaking objectives.Added five animated training targets.Added clear mouse, keyboard, and controller instructions.Added guided Mother Ship interactions.Players now build the Collector Lab and receive their first Collector for free.Added a hold-to-skip tutorial option.Skipping safely grants the Collector Lab and first Collector, then starts the first specimen encounter.Font & Readability ImprovementsAdded PIXEL and READABLE font","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T22:21:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881055","ve